@startuml target_slash_command_boundaries
title Target-only Builtin Command Layers
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@0bb794f2 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/command/CompositeCommandRegistry.java resolve.
' Architecture change: JSON command execution uses narrow services and no generic lifecycle store.
skinparam shadowing false
package "Web boundary" {
  class CommandController
  class RequestVO
  class ResponseVO
}
package "Application - singleton" {
  class CommandCatalogService
  class CommandExecutionService
  class CommandResponseAssembler
}
package "Core" {
  interface CommandDefinitionSource
  class BuiltinCommandSource
  class CompositeCommandRegistry
  class ResolvedCommandCatalog <<request snapshot>>
}
package "Domain and infrastructure" {
  interface NarrowCommandService
  class SessionRepository
  class RuntimeCoordinator
}
CommandController --> CommandCatalogService
CommandController --> CommandExecutionService
CommandController ..> RequestVO
CommandController ..> ResponseVO
CommandExecutionService --> CommandResponseAssembler
CommandCatalogService --> CompositeCommandRegistry
CommandExecutionService --> CompositeCommandRegistry
CompositeCommandRegistry o-- "1..*" CommandDefinitionSource
BuiltinCommandSource ..|> CommandDefinitionSource
CompositeCommandRegistry --> ResolvedCommandCatalog : resolve once
CommandExecutionService --> NarrowCommandService : selected handler
NarrowCommandService --> SessionRepository : row lock
NarrowCommandService --> RuntimeCoordinator : operation lock
CommandResponseAssembler ..> ResponseVO : DTO to VO
@enduml

@startuml target_command_resolution_classes
title Target-only Immutable Request Catalog
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@0bb794f2 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/command/ResolvedCommandCatalog.java.
' Design reason: catalog, admission, and dispatch share definition identity; Help content uses Agent metadata instead.
skinparam shadowing false
interface CommandDefinition
class BuiltinCommandDefinition
class SkillCommandDefinition
interface CommandHandler
interface CommandAdmissionPolicy
class ResolvedCommandCatalog <<immutable request snapshot>>
class CommandExecutionContext <<request snapshot>>
class CommandExecutionService
BuiltinCommandDefinition ..|> CommandDefinition
SkillCommandDefinition ..|> CommandDefinition
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-- CommandHandler
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-- CommandAdmissionPolicy
ResolvedCommandCatalog *-- "0..*" CommandDefinition
CommandExecutionContext o-- "1" ResolvedCommandCatalog
CommandExecutionService --> CommandExecutionContext : same definition identity
note right of SkillCommandDefinition
Current discovery definition.
No fake Handler; execution is target-only.
Excluded before source resolution
for BUILTIN requests.
end note
@enduml

@startuml authoritative_command_state
title Target-only Authoritative Command State
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d84dd3d6 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/db/gaussdb/install/session_schema.sql t_sessions.
' Architecture change: current name and existing domain entries replace generic command history.
skinparam shadowing false
rectangle "Help / Status / Skills" as Read
rectangle Name
rectangle "Model / Thinking / Compact" as Domain
database "Current Session state" as Session
database "Existing domain Entries" as Entries
Read --> Session : observe only
Name --> Session : current displayName and version
Domain --> Session : atomic state
Domain --> Entries : authoritative changes only
note bottom
No public commandId or generic command lifecycle.
No Name history sidecar.
Queries, same-value updates, and empty compaction append nothing.
end note
@enduml
